            </note>
            <note corresp="#d167-f3" n="70" xml:id="d167-f3-content">
                <p>Allied Force Headquarters at Caserta.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d167-f4" n="71" xml:id="d167-f4-content">
                <p>For documentation on the revolution that began at Athens on December 3, 1944, and
                    the intervention by British military forces, see <ref
                        target="frus1944v05#pg_141">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1944, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>, pp. 141</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus1944v05#pg_179">179</ref>, <hi rendition="#italic">passim</hi>,
                    and <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg98">pp. 98</ref>–<ref
                        target="#pg193">193</ref>, <hi rendition="#italic">passim</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
